---
// Standart Seri — /segmentler/standart-seri. Second page of the
// "Segmentler" series (see header.data.ts's brandsMega third column),
// following Premium Seri. Same candidacy-based content genre — this
// page's own angle is the balanced, everyday tier rather than the
// top-of-line one. Built on the same master templates and shared,
// data-driven components used throughout devicesMega and Premium Seri
// (same KulakArkasiComparison component, already generic, reused
// as-is).
//
// The TechEvolution "stage" slot reuses Premium Seri's own genuine
// three-rung tier ladder (Ekonomik -> Standart -> Premium), with
// "bestFor" swapped to "Bu sayfanın konusu" on the Standart rung. The
// KulakArkasiComparison table completes the ladder's pairwise coverage:
// Premium Seri already compares Premium vs Standart, so this page
// covers the other adjacent pair, Standart vs Ekonomik.
//
// accentColor: gök mavisi / sky-600 (#0284c7) — second color in the
// fresh accent rotation opened for this series on Premium Seri's
// hero.ts; see that file for the full rationale, including why this
// page's hero image comes from the site's wider brand catalog (Vista B)
// rather than one of the six primary brands.
//
// 14-section flow, in order: Hero -> Nedir? -> Kimler İçin Uygun? ->
// Avantajları -> Dikkat Edilmesi Gerekenler -> Seri Karşılaştırması
// (Ekonomik/Standart/Premium ladder) -> Öne Çıkan Özellikler ->
// Teknolojiler -> Markalara Göre İnceleyin -> Standart vs Ekonomik Seri
// -> Uzman Yorumu -> SSS -> Premium CTA -> İlgili İçerikler.
